    256cf74ce068994b t("Owner: screen 1 is Home with sessions; screen 2 is the full technical picture — hosts, projects, tasks — live, for a TV: it pulses while work runs, and when something breaks it is obvious at once. Built from the Runners data (executions_runners, execution_totals, executions_ci) plus hosts and delivery. Totals are today's real numbers from /runners; slot contents are illustrative. Every element opens its detail (host, task, PR).",Inter,16,r,align(l),lh(1.55)) p(0,80) s(1700,hug:49.6) f[(dd5108afcd8b2bb6,#B4B9C1)] "Text 3"
